    "Baggage copies entry records at input and output boundaries, preserving opaque metadata identity.",
    "TraceState set validates string keys and values; overflow parsing preserves wire order.",
    "Immutable TraceState tracks serialized length and caches serialized output.",
    "Retains the 1.10.0 global API compatibility version and symbol, including experimental exports; omits source maps."
  ],
  "scope": "API and no-op implementations, not a telemetry SDK/exporter. Original global registration and provider interoperability remain in place."
}
